# api_takeoff_emergency.scn — `emergency` while `takeoff` is still waiting for FLYING
#                             `takeoff` が FLYING を待っている最中の `emergency`
#
# The API task blocks inside `takeoff` (waitUntil) until the auto-takeoff reaches FLYING. An
# `emergency` that arrives meanwhile must NOT wait for that: the wait keeps reading the command
# sources, stops the motors at once, and the interrupted `takeoff` answers
# "error interrupted by emergency". An `emergency` read only after the takeoff had finished
# would leave the motors running for the rest of the wait.
#
# API タスクは `takeoff` の中（waitUntil）で、自動離陸が FLYING に達するまで待機する。その間に
# 届いた `emergency` はそれを待ってはならない: 待機はコマンド源を読み続け、即座にモータを止め、
# 打ち切られた `takeoff` は "error interrupted by emergency" を返す。離陸の完了後にやっと読まれる `emergency` では、
# 待機の残り時間のあいだモータが回り続ける。
#
# An emergency must not be followed by a re-takeoff: while the takeoff waits, three more lines
# arrive — a second `takeoff`, `height?` and an `rc`. The `emergency` must DISCARD the parked
# lines and answer each "error cancelled by emergency" (the `rc` is dropped at once: a stale
# stick input is never replayed). A parked `takeoff` that ran right after the
# emergency would make the craft take off again.
# emergency の後に再離陸しない: takeoff の待機中に、二つ目の `takeoff`・`height?`・`rc` の
# 3 行が届く。`emergency` は後回しの行を「捨て」、それぞれに "error cancelled by emergency" を
# 返す（`rc` はその場で捨てる: 古いスティック入力を再生しない）。後回しの `takeoff` が
# emergency の直後に実行されると、機体が再び離陸してしまう。
#
# Timeline: takeoff at 6.0 s, the extra lines at 6.5 s, emergency at 7.0 s (the climb is under way).
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/api_takeoff_emergency.scn --target vehicle --duration 14000000
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz>
   0    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50      # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    api        "command"                                          # B: enter SDK mode (t=6)
   +    api        "takeoff"                                          # C: takeoff -> ARM -> auto-takeoff climb (t=6)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     500       50      # D: the climb runs (to t=6.5)
   +    api        "takeoff"                                          # second takeoff, parked during the wait
   +    api        "height?"                                          # parked during the wait
   +    api        "rc 0 0 50 0"                                      # dropped at once (never replayed)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     500       50      # the climb runs on (to t=7)
   +    api        "emergency"                                        # E: t=7.0 s — emergency while takeoff waits
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50      # F: motors must be stopped (to t=13)
